{"page":337,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:39","surah":22,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"أُذِنَ لِلَّذِينَ يُقَـٰتَلُونَ بِأَنَّهُمْ ظُلِمُوا۟ ۚ وَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ نَصْرِهِمْ لَقَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who have been attacked are permitted to take up arms because they have been wronged- God has the power to help them-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُذِنَ","en_gloss":"Permission is given","transliteration":"udhina","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُقَـٰتَلُونَ","en_gloss":"are being fought","transliteration":"yuqātalūna","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"because they","transliteration":"bi-annahum","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظُلِمُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"were wronged","transliteration":"ẓulimū","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَصْرِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their victory","transliteration":"naṣrihim","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَقَدِيرٌ","en_gloss":"(is) surely Able","transliteration":"laqadīrun","verse_key":"22:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:39"}]},{"verse_key":"22:40","surah":22,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ أُخْرِجُوا۟ مِن دِيَـٰرِهِم بِغَيْرِ حَقٍّ إِلَّآ أَن يَقُولُوا۟ رَبُّنَا ٱللَّهُ ۗ وَلَوْلَا دَفْعُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلنَّاسَ بَعْضَهُم بِبَعْضٍ لَّهُدِّمَتْ صَوَٰمِعُ وَبِيَعٌ وَصَلَوَٰتٌ وَمَسَـٰجِدُ يُذْكَرُ فِيهَا ٱسْمُ ٱللَّهِ كَثِيرًا ۗ وَلَيَنصُرَنَّ ٱللَّهُ مَن يَنصُرُهُۥٓ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَقَوِىٌّ عَزِيزٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who have been driven unjustly from their homes only for saying, ‘Our Lord is God.’ If God did not repel some people by means of others, many monasterie